---
globs: src/**/*.py,tests/**/*.py
alwaysApply: false
---

- Use `uv` for all dependency operations. Check for the existing `.fipro-env` virtualenv before creating a new one.
- Dataclasses over attrs or pydantic. Always set `slots=True` on dataclasses (see [src/models/transactions.py](src/models/transactions.py)).
- Use `Decimal` for money. Never `float`.
- Use `Enum` for fixed choice sets (see `TransactionType`, `TransactionStatus`).
- Tests live under `tests/` and use pytest. Fixtures go under `tests/fixtures/`.
- Test fixtures must be anonymized. Never commit fixtures containing real names, UPI IDs, phone numbers, account numbers, or other PII. This rule exists because PR #8 accidentally committed real data.
- When adding a dependency, run `uv lock` and stage the resulting `uv.lock` alongside the code change.
